      // ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
      //  REMOVED: Bulgarian e-Authentication (SAML 2.0) scaffold.
      //  System now uses Google Sign-In + Google 2FA exclusively.
      //  All eAuth/SAML/eIDAS/Mobile-КЕП/eDelivery integrations
